                    <p>Optimized performance for smooth user experience and quick data processing</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon">
                        <i class="bi bi-puzzle"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Fully Customizable</h3>
                    <p>Tailor the system to match your organization's unique requirements</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon">
                        <i class="bi bi-person-check"></i>
                    </div>
